{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_235_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_235","textTraditional":"一、七年，春，宋皇瑗帥師侵鄭。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_235_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_235","textTraditional":"二、晉魏曼多帥師侵衞。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_235_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_235","textTraditional":"三、夏，公會吳於繒。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_235_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_235","textTraditional":"四、秋，公伐邾。八月，己酉，入邾，以邾子益來。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_235_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_235","textTraditional":"以者，不以者也。益之名，惡也。春秋有臨天下之言焉，有臨一國之言焉，有臨一家之言焉。其言來者，有外魯之辭焉。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_235_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_235","textTraditional":"五、宋人圍曹。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_235_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_235","textTraditional":"六、冬，鄭駟弘帥師救曹。","sentenceOrder":7}],"overrides":{}}